            "review_title": "Review at Flamingo Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "LifeExplorer\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam345 contributions\n0\nFinally an international standard restaurant in Dong Hoi!\nMay 2025 • Family\nLocated within the luxurious voco Quang Binh Resort, this Restaurant and Bar offers an exceptional dining experience that truly stands out. The atmosphere is warm and inviting, with nice views over the pool that create a perfect setting for a relaxed lunch or intimate dinner.\n\nThe menu is a creative fusion of Vietnamese and European cuisines, with innovative flavors and beautifully presented dishes. \n\nComplementing the fantastic food is a lively selection of innovative cocktails and engaging staff who make you feel truly welcome. Good background music with a vibrant yet relaxing vibe.\n\nWe had a great time here - thank you to the amazing team. They are way above the local standards in this town - this is the first international standard restaurant in Quang Binh...this will easily become the best restaurant in town!\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2025\nDining- v\nXin chao Crisper, \n\nThanks for checking us out and taking the time to share your dining experience in our Flamingo Restaurant and Bar, voco Quang Binh resort. \nGlad to hear that you were really enjoy with our food, drink, service and having a great time in here. \nHope to see you again soon. \n\nThank you. \nFlamingo Restaurant and Bar, voco Quang Binh resort.\nRead more\nWritten June 26, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
